together, or hide alone. Play however you like!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873490/extras/f5c269d4dc5f4834b3242b193a2251d9.avif?t=1748805917\" width=800 height=422 /></span><strong>Need more variety?</strong> Switch it up with more Traitors and additional roles like the <strong>VIPs</strong> and <strong>Joker</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize countless settings for your lobby, creating unique scenarios and challenges that change gameplay every time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And what's best of all: No server setup, no mods needed, no external voice chat needed. Start the game, invite your friends, and let CHAOS happen!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want more?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here are even more features to expect:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ADS support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More customization options coming over time!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More maps, weapons, and tools to keep the fun over 9000</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Localization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our promise for continuous bug fixes, updates, additions, and balancing!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And much, much more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So what are you waiting for?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist BETRAYED now </strong>and get ready to jump into pure chaos with up to 16 friends!</p>",
